{
  "about": "Outcomes, gh calls, required references, block hashes, markers, and notes of the TypeScript activity digest on the digest edge days, run in order on one vault copy; see test/contract/snapshot.ts. A day's differs_from_python names the allowlist entries that described how the retired Python digest's result differed.",
  "allowlist": {
    "opened-pr-keying": "Python hid an opened PR when a PR with the same number merged that day in any repository; TypeScript hides only the PR that itself merged (same repository and number), so it lists the other PR, and the day's block and hash differ.",
    "repository-qualified-links": "The TypeScript prompt requires each PR and issue as a link with its repository and number (`[#N](https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/N)`), and the completeness check accepts only that link; Python required `#N`, which one mention satisfied for two repositories. The required references reduce to the same numbers; the note does not change."
  },
